<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#intervalFinishes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "If T1 :intervalFinishes T2, then the beginning of T1 is after the beginning of T2, and the end of T1 is coincident with the end of T2."@en .
