<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#notDisjoint> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "This relation is the complement of :disjoint and is the disjoint union of equals, whollyContains, intervalNotDisjoint. However, that is outside OWL-2 expressivity, so is implemented as an explicit property, with equals, whollyContains, intervalNotDisjoint as sub-properties"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#notDisjoint> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "If T1 :notDisjoint T2, then the two temporal entities overlap or coincide in some way, but their ordering relationship is not known."@en .
