<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#DayOfWeek> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Remove enumeration from definition, in order to allow other days to be used when required in other calendars. \r\nNOTE: existing days are still present as members of the class, but the class membership is now open. \r\n\r\nIn the original OWL-Time the following constraint appeared: \r\n  owl:oneOf (\r\n      time:Monday\r\n      time:Tuesday\r\n      time:Wednesday\r\n      time:Thursday\r\n      time:Friday\r\n      time:Saturday\r\n      time:Sunday\r\n    ) ;"@en .
