<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:B13ad064e0e224a671c4263abc1c0e1ff .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:B9dc381f179d2ddca52c7856167c93ff3 .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:Bfe14c9518d2cf1b68ac46c8d7a670f75 .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:B06e8279284c9072d24f345b23c9f16c4 .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:Bd9e7bd85ebd54cceb710296633af7d3b .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:B2c47a640a55d9f0fc44c658c34db840c .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:Bd868246481ef007abd2fab7b8291e158 .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalPosition> .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "descripción de fecha-hora generalizada"@es .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Some combinations of properties are redundant - for example, within a specified :year if :dayOfYear is provided then :day and :month can be computed, and vice versa. Individual values should be consistent with each other and the calendar, indicated through the value of the :hasTRS property." .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:Bc9ed3838750fb0dd731ea21de46ff746 .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:B7b34a960d102eabb2ab2300cf6a15a4f .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:B3cf69d8edfa73b1b973893cec117c2ec .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#GeneralDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Generalized date-time description"@en .
