<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasDateTimeDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Value of DateTimeInterval expressed as a structured value. The beginning and end of the interval coincide with the limits of the shortest element in the description."@en .
